Data and Code related to the analysis

refZ_upstream       - data, code and environment related to analysis of refZ upstream region
DESeq_all           - result data from DESeq2 analysis
ORA                 - results from overrepresentation analysis by ClusterProfiler
                      - use code withing with R_env.yaml conda environment
venns               - venn diagrams from DE genes
                      - use code withing with Python_env.yaml conda environment
assign_sigma        - plots and sigma factor assignement based on subtiwiki 
                      - use upset_plots.ipynb with Python_env.yaml conda environment

make_overview.ipynb - draw heatmap of all genes 
                      - use code with Python_env.yaml conda environment
                    
